Here's what I wrote to Robin:
 I've not tried yet, still trying to get 100% of the "deep gismu" list down
(i.e., all the piddling little tergi'u for every gismu) before I tackle the
rafsi list, although I probably know a couple of hundred of those that have
been used in lujvo, and those that in fake lujvo that I've looked up based
on English words, names, and anagrams of English phrases

  Well, I just sat down and tried to pour out all those that I remember off
the top of my head, and here's what I came up with-- 107, with quite a
variety represented.  I"m sure I know more (in fact, I just came up with
lot more that I know  as I was writing this sentence-- vac/vanci,
tic/tcica, ku'a/kumfa, cen/centi, mil/milti,  pi'e/plipe, suj/sumji,
soi/sonci, sro/sorcu, val/valsi, vla/valsi, bai/bapli, maf/makfa,
sez/sevzi, xru/xruti and jup/jukpa, bringing the total to 123, but I don't
feel like reformatting...) , but this is what I came up with

 bri bridi gi'a gidva lan lanme nor no'e spa spati  bro xebro gi'u gismu lik
litki nu'o nu'o ste liste  bur bunre gle gletu lob lojbo pav pa tce mutce
bu'u bukpu gli glico loj logji ple pelji tel stela  ci'a ciska gre pagre lot
bloti pli pilno tem temci  ci'e ciste gu'e gugde ma'e marce pre prenu ter te
cpi cipni gug gugde mal mabla pu'i punji tin tirna  cpu lacpu gu'i gusni
ma'o cmavo rai traji tre mitre  cre certu ja'a jatna mar manri rap rapli tro
jitro  dad dandu ja'o jarco mer merko rei preti tru turni  dau darlu jba
jbari mes mensi rel re tur stura  deg degji jbe jbena mon morna rib cribe
vel ve  di'u dinju jbi jibni mor morko ric tricu ve'u vecnu  dza da jbo
lojbo mum mu rod broda vip vipsi              von vo      xeb xebro      xel
xe      xi'a xirma      xi'u xislu      zda zdani      ze'a zenba      zga
zgana

                        --gejyspa

